=Vehicle Store=
{{img:units/Vehicle Store.png}}
*  Health: 8
*  Price: %Minerals% 40
*  [[concepts/sensory|Scanning range]]: 2
* Max Vehicles per Store: 4
Vehicle stores can be used to store vehicles which will then enter hibernation until deployed. This structure shares storage with nearby structures of the same type. A vehicle store can deploy any vehicle found within the vehicle store compound.
